            subtitle: "투자자와의 비즈니스 협상",
            korean: `<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="last month our startup" data-pronunciation="지난달 우리 스타트업은 [jinandal uri seutateuebeun]">지난달 우리 스타트업은</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="to attract Series A investment" data-pronunciation="시리즈 A 투자 유치를 위해 [sirijeu A tuja yuchireul wihae]">시리즈 A 투자 유치를 위해</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="before a major VC firm" data-pronunciation="대형 VC 앞에서 [daehyeong VC apeseo]">대형 VC 앞에서</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="gave a presentation" data-pronunciation="프레젠테이션을 진행했습니다 [peurejentaeisyeoneul jinhaenghaetseumnida]">프레젠테이션을 진행했습니다</span>.</p>
<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="market analysis data and" data-pronunciation="시장 분석 데이터와 [sijang bunseok deiteowa]">시장 분석 데이터와</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="growth prospects presented" data-pronunciation="성장 전망을 제시한 바 [seongjang jeonmangeul jesihan ba]">성장 전망을 제시한 바</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="investors' interest" data-pronunciation="투자자들의 관심을 [tujajadeului gwansimeul]">투자자들의 관심을</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="were able to attract" data-pronunciation="끌 수 있었습니다 [kkeul su isseotseumnida]">끌 수 있었습니다</span>.</p>
<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="regarding the business model" data-pronunciation="수익 모델에 대한 [suik modere daehan]">수익 모델에 대한</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="even if there were sharp questions" data-pronunciation="날카로운 질문이 있더라도 [nalkkaroun jilmuni itdeorado]">날카로운 질문이 있더라도</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="since we prepared sufficiently" data-pronunciation="충분히 준비했기에 [chungbunhi junbihaetgi-e]">충분히 준비했기에</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="answered confidently" data-pronunciation="자신 있게 답변했습니다 [jasin itge dabbyeonhaetseumnida]">자신 있게 답변했습니다</span>.</p>
<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="during the negotiation process" data-pronunciation="협상 과정에서는 [hyeopsang gwajeongeseoneun]">협상 과정에서는</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="regarding company valuation" data-pronunciation="기업 가치 평가를 두고 [gieop gachi pyeonggareul dugo]">기업 가치 평가를 두고</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="there were intense discussions, however" data-pronunciation="치열한 논의가 있었으나 [chiyeolhan nonuiga isseosseuna]">치열한 논의가 있었으나</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="to respect each other's positions" data-pronunciation="서로의 입장을 존중하고자 [seoroui ipjangeul jonjunghagoja]">서로의 입장을 존중하고자</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="a reasonable compromise" data-pronunciation="합리적인 타협점을 [hamnijeoin tahyeopjeomeul]">합리적인 타협점을</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="had to find" data-pronunciation="찾기 마련이었습니다 [chatgi maryeonieotseumnida]">찾기 마련이었습니다</span>.</p>`,
            translation: "Last month, our startup gave a presentation before a major VC firm to attract Series A investment. By presenting market analysis data and growth prospects, we were able to attract investors' interest. Even when there were sharp questions about the business model, we answered confidently because we had prepared thoroughly. During negotiations, there were intense discussions about company valuation, but to respect each other's positions, we found a reasonable compromise.",
