            korean: `<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="with the development of digital technology" data-pronunciation="디지털 기술의 발전으로 [dijiteol gisurui baljeoneuro]">디지털 기술의 발전으로</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="ways of consuming culture" data-pronunciation="문화 향유 방식이 [munhwa hyangyu bangsigi]">문화 향유 방식이</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="have fundamentally changed" data-pronunciation="근본적으로 변화한 바 [geunbonjeog-euro byeonhwahan ba]">근본적으로 변화한 바</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="a new paradigm" data-pronunciation="새로운 패러다임이 [saeroun paereodaimi]">새로운 패러다임이</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="has emerged" data-pronunciation="등장했습니다 [deungjanghaetseumnida]">등장했습니다</span>.</p>
<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="through virtual reality museums" data-pronunciation="가상현실 박물관을 통해 [gasanghyeonsil bangmulgwaneul tonghae]">가상현실 박물관을 통해</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="without time and space limitations" data-pronunciation="시공간의 제약 없이 [sigongganui jeyak eopsi]">시공간의 제약 없이</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="to appreciate cultural heritage" data-pronunciation="문화재를 감상하고자 [munhwajaereul gamsanghagoja]">문화재를 감상하고자</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="demand is growing" data-pronunciation="하는 수요가 늘고 있습니다 [haneun suyoga neulgo itseumnida]">하는 수요가 늘고 있습니다</span>.</p>
<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="the NFT art market" data-pronunciation="NFT 아트 시장이 [NFT ateu sijang-i]">NFT 아트 시장이</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="even if controversial" data-pronunciation="논란이 있더라도 [nonrani itdeorado]">논란이 있더라도</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="for artists new" data-pronunciation="작가들에게 새로운 [jakgadeul-ege saeroun]">작가들에게 새로운</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="revenue opportunities" data-pronunciation="수익 창출 기회를 [suik changchul gihoereul]">수익 창출 기회를</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="provides, therefore" data-pronunciation="제공하기에 [jegonghagi-e]">제공하기에</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="cannot be ignored" data-pronunciation="무시할 수 없습니다 [musihal su eopseumnida]">무시할 수 없습니다</span>.</p>
<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="precisely the fusion of tradition and technology" data-pronunciation="전통과 기술의 융합이야말로 [jeontong-gwa gisurui yunghab-iyamallo]">전통과 기술의 융합이야말로</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="the key of the future cultural industry" data-pronunciation="미래 문화산업의 핵심이 [mirae munhwasaneopui haeksimi]">미래 문화산업의 핵심이</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="will become" data-pronunciation="되기 마련입니다 [doegi maryeonimnida]">되기 마련입니다</span>.</p>`,
            translation: "With the development of digital technology, ways of consuming culture have fundamentally changed, and a new paradigm has emerged. Through virtual reality museums, demand is growing for appreciating cultural heritage without time and space limitations. Even if the NFT art market is controversial, it provides artists with new revenue opportunities and cannot be ignored. The fusion of tradition and technology will become the key to the future cultural industry.",
