<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="restoration master" data-pronunciation="복원 장인 [bogwon jangin]">복원 장인</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="Mr. Park" data-pronunciation="박 선생님은 [pak seonsaengnimeun]">박 선생님은</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="says" data-pronunciation="말합니다 [malhamnida]">말합니다</span>. <span class="korean-word" data-translation="hanok" data-pronunciation="한옥은 [hanogeun]">한옥은</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="with nature" data-pronunciation="자연과 [jayeongwa]">자연과</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="harmonious" data-pronunciation="조화로운 [johwaroun]">조화로운</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="architecture" data-pronunciation="건축입니다 [geonchugimnida]">건축입니다</span>. <span class="korean-word" data-translation="wood" data-pronunciation="나무는 [namuneun]">나무는</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="breathes" data-pronunciation="숨을 쉬고 [sumeul swigo]">숨을 쉬고</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="clay" data-pronunciation="흙은 [heukeun]">흙은</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="moisture" data-pronunciation="습기를 [seupgireul]">습기를</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="regulates" data-pronunciation="조절합니다 [jojeolhamnida]">조절합니다</span>. <span class="korean-word" data-translation="when restoring" data-pronunciation="복원할 때 [bogwonhal ttae]">복원할 때</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="these principles" data-pronunciation="이 원리를 [i wonrireul]">이 원리를</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="must understand" data-pronunciation="이해해야 합니다 [ihaehaeya hamnida]">이해해야 합니다</span>.</p>
