            korean: `<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="microplastics" data-pronunciation="미세 플라스틱은 [mise peullaseutikeun]">미세 플라스틱은</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="are a serious environmental problem" data-pronunciation="심각한 환경 문제입니다 [simgakhan hwangyeong munjeimnida]">심각한 환경 문제입니다</span>. <span class="korean-word" data-translation="small plastic particles under 5mm" data-pronunciation="5mm 이하의 작은 플라스틱 조각들이 [omm ihaui jageun peullaseutik jogakdeuri]">5mm 이하의 작은 플라스틱 조각들이</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="are polluting the ocean" data-pronunciation="바다를 오염시키고 있습니다 [badareul oyeomsikigo itseumnida]">바다를 오염시키고 있습니다</span>.</p>
<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="Korean scientists" data-pronunciation="한국 과학자들은 [hanguk gwahakjadeureun]">한국 과학자들은</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="around Jeju Island" data-pronunciation="제주도 주변 [jejudo jubyeon]">제주도 주변</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="seawater" data-pronunciation="해수를 [haesureul]">해수를</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="are studying" data-pronunciation="조사하고 있습니다 [josahago itseumnida]">조사하고 있습니다</span>. <span class="korean-word" data-translation="research results" data-pronunciation="연구 결과 [yeongu gyeolga]">연구 결과</span>, <span class="korean-word" data-translation="in fish and marine organisms" data-pronunciation="물고기와 해양 생물의 [mulgogiwa haeyang saengmurui]">물고기와 해양 생물의</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="inside the body" data-pronunciation="몸속에서 [momsokeseo]">몸속에서</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="microplastics" data-pronunciation="미세 플라스틱이 [mise peullaseutigi]">미세 플라스틱이</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="were found" data-pronunciation="발견되었습니다 [balgyeondoeeotseumnida]">발견되었습니다</span>.</p>
<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="lead researcher" data-pronunciation="연구 책임자 [yeongu chaeimja]">연구 책임자</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="Dr. Park" data-pronunciation="박 박사는 [bak baksaneun]">박 박사는</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="warns" data-pronunciation="경고합니다 [gyeonggohamnida]">경고합니다</span>. <span class="korean-word" data-translation="this" data-pronunciation="이것은 [igeoseun]">이것은</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="only the ocean's problem" data-pronunciation="바다만의 문제가 [badamanui munjega]">바다만의 문제가</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="is not" data-pronunciation="아닙니다 [animnida]">아닙니다</span>. <span class="korean-word" data-translation="ultimately" data-pronunciation="결국 [gyeolguk]">결국</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="through the food chain" data-pronunciation="먹이 사슬을 통해 [meogi saseureul tonghae]">먹이 사슬을 통해</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="to the human body" data-pronunciation="인간의 몸으로 [inganui momeuro]">인간의 몸으로</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="returns" data-pronunciation="돌아옵니다 [doraonimnida]">돌아옵니다</span>. <span class="korean-word" data-translation="reducing plastic use" data-pronunciation="플라스틱 사용 줄이기가 [peullaseutik sayong jurigiga]">플라스틱 사용 줄이기가</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="is urgent" data-pronunciation="시급합니다 [sigeupamnida]">시급합니다</span>.</p>`,
